OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FVariable
OL,6,Fcloud with clear spells and showers
OL,7,Fthrough the evening, some heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Clear spells and showers
OL,9,Fcontinuing overnight. Breezy at first,
OL,10,Fthen winds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,13,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,14,Fmorning, which may be heavy. Showers
OL,15,Feasing through the afternoon leading
OL,16,Fto dry conditions in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
