OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells Saturday, but
OL,7,Fthe odd light shower possible. Dry
OL,8,Fwith bright or sunny spells and winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening Sunday. Mostly cloudy
OL,10,FMonday with patchy rain, strong winds.
